{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05390","headline":"奉和圣制同二相以下羣官乐游园宴 · 胡皓","name":"奉和圣制同二相以下羣官乐游园宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五酺终宴集，三锡又欢娱。\n仙阜崇高异，神州眺览殊。\n南山临皓雪，北阙对明珠。\n广座鵷鸿满，昌庭驷马趋。\n绮罗含草树，丝竹吐郊衢。\n衔杯不能罢，歌舞乐唐虞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"胡皓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05390.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05390","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}